// Precision gallery corrections:
// - Cooled jars keep the exact orange-jar shape/photo composition; only body colour changes.
// - Empty-jars gallery removes the 10L jar and shows the water dispenser instead.
// - Category-card images use clearer single-product references where appropriate.
